      "writtenOn": "2020-05-11T19:34:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Rather than putting this field in ProblemDetails, and causing a cyclic type, it might be cleaner to move it into Error. This more closely matches how subproblems are defined in 8555 (i.e. a subproblem cannot itself contain subproblems). This should still fit the RFC/golang type match since subproblems are a 8555 invention, rather than a generic 7807 field.",
      "revId": "7761e46a3f78223adda818ea9462f1442a052486",
